//Evil Boss Gallery: a door of the Evil Boss Gallery (the Boss Gallery's doors, in its copy, with their creation code:
//type, bossName...). Its boss's evil fight (evgRoom: evgRoomOf), or sealed while the boss has none. As a gallery
//door otherwise: its user event 0 is the gallery's loadout for the boss, and the gallery lever's normalized builds work
//the same way
evgRoom=evgRoomOf(type)
